<h4 class="close">Serial Numbers and Dates of Manufacture</h4>
<p>The serial number on Bolex 150 Super cameras is located on the bottom of the lens housing, just above the trigger release and exposure lock; it can be used to determine the year in which it was manufactured.
</p>
